SkillBuilder 1: Branding / charity: water
Project: Design a Landing Page for charity: water

YOUR TASK 

As a Digital Marketing Associate, you'll create a new landing page designed specifically for college students. 
The goal: educate students about the global water crisis while empowering them to take action through donations.

You will design a new charity:water landing page using CanvaLinks to an external site. that inspires and engages college students by:
- Eye-Catching, On-Brand Visuals: Bold imagery and/or impactful videos that tell a story
- Relatable Messaging: A tone that speaks to your target audience's passion for change.
- Strong Call-to-Action: Inspiring your audience to donate to the cause. 
